      "id": "kp16-03-map",
      "slot": "concept",
      "kind": "compare-card",
      "title": "类型转换：合法文本能转成数字，非法文本却不报错",
      "panels": [
        {
          "label": "合法文本 '15'",
          "tone": "good",
          "columns": [
            "原文本"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "15"
            ]
          ],
          "big": {
            "label": "CAST('15' AS DECIMAL(12,2))",
            "value": 15
          },
          "check": {
            "sql": "SELECT CAST('15' AS DECIMAL(12,2))",
            "expected": [
              [
                15
              ]
            ]
          },
          "note": "格式合法，转换后可以参与计算。"
        },
        {
          "label": "非法文本 'abc'",
          "tone": "bad",
          "columns": [
            "原文本"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "abc"
            ]
          ],
          "big": {
            "label": "CAST('abc' AS DECIMAL(12,2))",
            "value": 0
          },
          "check": {
            "sql": "SELECT CAST('abc' AS DECIMAL(12,2))",
            "expected": [
              [
                0
              ]
            ]
          },
          "note": "没有报错，悄悄变成了 0。"
        }
      ],
      "conclusion": "转换前要先验证格式和范围；否则汇总时，非法值会被当成 0 混进去。"
